        "name": "Build Kitchen Light Toggle",
        "func": "// Down Paddle: Single Tap matched - build a Home Assistant action call for a\n// smart bulb bound behind this dimmer, same as Message Fields does but shown\n// here explicitly for clarity.\nmsg.payload = {\n    action: \"light.toggle\",\n    target: { entity_id: \"light.kitchen_smart_bulb\" },\n};\nreturn msg;",
